WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,800
I heard that the headmistress Fu’s family is having a banquet today

2
00:00:02,800 --> 00:00:06,400
Many celebrities and dignitaries in Nancheng crowded their heads to attend.

3
00:00:06,400 --> 00:00:08,260
What a coincidence

4
00:00:08,260 --> 00:00:10,460
The female leader Fu is also named Lu

5
00:00:10,460 --> 00:00:11,900
So what

6
00:00:11,900 --> 00:00:15,740
There are so many people named Lu in the world.

7
00:00:15,740 --> 00:00:19,740
The Su family is here

8
00:00:19,740 --> 00:00:23,470
The Pei family and the Su family have always been on good terms.

9
00:00:23,470 --> 00:00:26,470
But I didn't expect that his grandson would be in danger.

10
00:00:26,470 --> 00:00:28,530
Someone came to help me live longer

11
00:00:28,530 --> 00:00:33,690
Really thoughtful

12
00:00:33,690 --> 00:00:37,090
This Su family is so sincere in helping me live my life, right?

13
00:00:37,290 --> 00:00:45,840
The head of the house actually came to my uncle in person

14
00:00:45,840 --> 00:00:47,640
I heard today is your birthday party

15
00:00:47,640 --> 00:00:48,940
I wish you happiness like the East Sea

16
00:00:48,940 --> 00:00:54,480
Shoubinan Mountain

17
00:00:54,480 --> 00:00:56,580
Why haven’t you met the Pei family’s daughter Xiaoguan?

18
00:00:56,580 --> 00:00:57,980
What about this?

19
00:00:57,980 --> 00:01:03,930
Jiaojiao, please say hello to your Uncle Su.

20
00:01:03,930 --> 00:01:06,320
Jiaojiao has grown so tall

21
00:01:06,320 --> 00:01:08,620
The last time I saw you, you were still a little kid.

22
00:01:08,620 --> 00:01:12,120
Our Jiaojiao will definitely be tall and thin in the future.

23
00:01:12,120 --> 00:01:14,320
Boyi, you don’t know

24
00:01:14,320 --> 00:01:18,720
The doctors all praised our Jiaojiaojiao for being taller than other children of the same age.

25
00:01:18,720 --> 00:01:21,840
Here comes another little rapist

26
00:01:21,840 --> 00:01:23,140
Yoyo

27
00:01:23,140 --> 00:01:25,040
That child is raising wild animals in the countryside

28
00:01:25,040 --> 00:01:27,240
Naughty missiles go up to the house to connect the tiles

29
00:01:27,240 --> 00:01:28,740
The etiquette is not thorough either

30
00:01:28,740 --> 00:01:31,040
I didn’t let her come out to see the guests today.

31
00:01:31,040 --> 00:01:32,940
What does she do on such a great day?

32
00:01:32,940 --> 00:01:34,040
Tell the truth

33
00:01:34,040 --> 00:01:36,340
I came here today just to see Youyou
